---
name: plan-review-complete
version: 1.0.0
description: Plan review report; the body of `atm task close <task-id> completed`. PASS closes the plan-review bead and releases the root sprints; FAIL leaves it open for the next round.
format: markdown
required_variables:
  - generated_at
  - task_id
  - root
  - phase
  - round
  - verdict
  - validate_plan_md
  - findings_blocking
  - findings_important
  - findings_minor
  - findings_md
  - reviewers_md
optional_variables:
  - carried_md
  - notes_md
defaults:
  carried_md: ""
  notes_md: ""
metadata:
  type: plan-review-complete
  tags:
    - stage:plan-review
    - orchestration:beads
  workflow:
    scope:
      kind: phase
      variable: phase
    state: plan-review-complete
    stage: plan-review
    transition: complete
---
{% if verdict not in ["PASS", "FAIL"] %}{{ verdict | verdict_must_be_PASS_or_FAIL }}ERROR: verdict must be PASS or FAIL, got {{ verdict }}
{% endif %}# Plan Review {{ verdict }}

Generated: {{ generated_at }}
Bead: {{ task_id }} (plan {{ root }}, phase {{ phase }}, round {{ round }})
Verdict: **{{ verdict }}** ({{ findings_blocking }} blocking, {{ findings_important }} important, {{ findings_minor }} minor)

## Machine Status (JSON)
```json
{
  "task": {{ task_id | tojson }},
  "root": {{ root | tojson }},
  "phase": {{ phase | tojson }},
  "round": {{ round | tojson }},
  "verdict": {{ verdict | tojson }},
  "findings": {"blocking": {{ findings_blocking }}, "important": {{ findings_important }}, "minor": {{ findings_minor }}}
}
```

## validate-plan
{{ validate_plan_md }}

## Findings
{{ findings_md }}
{% if carried_md %}
## Carried Findings
{{ carried_md }}
{% endif %}
## Reviewers
{{ reviewers_md }}
{% if notes_md %}
## Notes
{{ notes_md }}
{% endif %}
